{"id":"b73290a0af01d44f","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-closed-class.md","title":"闭类与有效闭类","display":"df-closed-class — 闭类与有效闭类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-closed-class","aliases":["20-df-closed-class"],"display":"df-closed-class — 闭类与有效闭类","chapter":"8","section":"8.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definitions 8.2.1–8.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[200],"source_printed_pages":[167],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cantor-space]]","[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-class — 闭类与有效闭类"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 8.2.1–8.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>200</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,U\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C,U\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Closed}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Open}(2^\\omega\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\n\\operatorname{code}[T]\\in\\mathcal R\\land C=[T]],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(U)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\mathcal E\\land\nU=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Closed}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Open}(2^\\omega\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\n\\operatorname{code}[T]\\in\\mathcal R\\land C=[T]],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(U)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\mathcal E\\land\nU=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有效类的载体为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span>，与自然数集合的算术层级区分。这里以可计算树定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\)</span> 类，以 c.e. 柱表示定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1\\)</span> 类；两种表示的补集等价及指标转换由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b222e27484042250\" href=\"?note=b222e27484042250\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence\">20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence</a> 证明。该链接是后续证明导航，不把表示定理反向列为定义依赖。一般闭类不自动拥有可计算树表示。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 8.2.1–8.2.2；印刷 167 / PDF 200。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cantor-space]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"b222e27484042250","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"有效类的载体为 $2^\\omega$，与自然数集合的算术层级区分。这里以可计算树定义 $\\Pi^0_1$ 类，以 c.e. 柱表示定义 $\\Sigma^0_1$ 类；两种表示的补集等价及指标转换由 [[20-thm-closed-class-tree-equivalence]] 证明。该链接是后续证明导航，不把表示定理反向列为定义依赖。一般闭类不自动拥有可计算树表示。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,U\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Closed}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Open}(2^\\omega\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{Tree}_2(T)\\land\n\\operatorname{code}[T]\\in\\mathcal R\\land C=[T]],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(U)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}[S]\\in\\mathcal E\\land\nU=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in S}[\\sigma]].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_1","display":false}],"bytes":1626,"backlinks":[{"id":"58f8766635c79a79","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-ml-measure-one]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"4da300de847d0dba","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-universal-ml]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"a03c2828834ee687","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-deg]]。"},{"id":"3225aa77bce6f46a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。"},{"id":"efc26dd0829b9c99","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-tree]]